# Crumple demo reel: 10 s at 60 fps.
#     crtest --film 600 --size 1280x720 --script docs/demo.cues | ffmpeg ...
# A flat page is crumpled -- big folds first, then smaller ones inside them --
# held, smoothed back out (the crease marks stay), and the lamp swings round.
0    Crumple         0
0    Flatten         0
240  Crumple         1
300  Crumple         1
300  Flatten         0
420  Flatten         0.75
420  Lamp Azimuth    0.375
600  Lamp Azimuth    0.875
